---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import profile from "../assets/profile.jpg";
---

<Layout title="Anson Chan">

<section class="hero">

<div class="hero-text">

<h1>
  Designing Trustworthy
  Human–AI Decision Systems
</h1>

<p class="affiliation">
  <strong>PhD Researcher</strong> · <strong>University of Cambridge</strong>
</p>

<p>
  I study how humans and increasingly capable AI systems can make trustworthy decisions together.
  My current research uses sustainable building retrofitting as a real-world laboratory for designing
  human–AI decision systems. Ultimately, I am interested in how people should think, decide, and govern
  in an age of increasingly capable AI.
</p>

<p class="personal">
  Beyond my research, I write about technologies, philosophy, cities, and ideas that shape humanities.
</p>

<a href="/research" class="hero-button">
  Current Research →
</a>

</div>

<div class="hero-photo">
  	<img
    src={profile.src}
    alt="Portrait of Anson Chan"
    class="profile-photo"
	/>
</div>

</section>

</Layout>